,\"name\":\"gateway/channels/openclaw-weixin\",\"parentNames\":[\"openclaw\"],\"date\":\"2026-04-01T10:47:52.008Z\",\"logLevelId\":3,\"logLevelName\":\"INFO\"},\"time\":\"2026-04-01T18:47:52.008+08:00\"}\r\n{\"0\":\"gateway/channels/openclaw-weixin\",\"1\":\"[runtime] setWeixinRuntime called, runtime set successfully\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"24.14.0\",\"hostname\":\"张启旺的G15\",\"name\":\"gateway/channels/openclaw-weixin\",\"parentNames\":[\"openclaw\"],\"date\":\"2026-04-01T10:47:52.009Z\",\"logLevelId\":3,\"logLevelName\":\"INFO\"},\"time\":\"2026-04-01T18:47:52.009+08:00\"}\r\n{\"0\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"plugins\\\"}\",\"1\":\"[plugins] openclaw-lark: loaded without install/load-path provenance; treat as untracked local code and pin trust via plugins.allow or install records (C:\\\\Users\\\\zhang\\\\.openclaw\\\\extensions\\\\feishu-openclaw-plugin\\\\index.js)\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"24.14.0\",\"hostname\":\"张启旺的G15\",\"name\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"plugins\\\"}\",\"parentNames\":[\"openclaw\"],\"date\":\"2026-04-01T10:47:52.010Z\",\"logLevelId\":4,\"logLevelName\":\"WARN\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///C:/Users/zhang/AppData/Local/Programs/ClawX/resources/openclaw/dist/subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js:454:14\",\"fileName\":\"subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js:454\",\"fileColumn\":\"14\",\"fileLine\":\"454\",\"filePath\":\"/C:/Users/zhang/AppData/Local/Programs/ClawX/resources/openclaw/dist/subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js\",\"filePathWithLine\":\"/C:/Users/zhang/AppData/Local/Programs/ClawX/resources/openclaw/dist/subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js:454\",\"method\":\"logToFile\"}},\"time\":\"2026-04-01T18:47:52.010+08:00\"}\r\n{\"0\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"plugins\\\"}\",\"1\":\"[plugins] openclaw-weixin: loaded without install/load-path provenance; treat as untracked local code and pin trust via plugins.allow or install records (C:\\\\Users\\\\zhang\\\\.openclaw\\\\extensions\\\\openclaw-weixin\\\\index.ts)\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"24.14.0\",\"hostname\":\"张启旺的G15\",\"name\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"plugins\\\"}\",\"parentNames\":[\"openclaw\"],\"date\":\"2026-04-01T10:47:52.012Z\",\"logLevelId\":4,\"logLevelName\":\"WARN\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///C:/Users/zhang/AppData/Local/Programs/ClawX/resources/openclaw/dist/subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js:454:14\",\"fileName\":\"subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js:454\",\"fileColumn\":\"14\",\"fileLine\":\"454\",\"filePath\":\"/C:/Users/zhang/AppData/Local/Programs/ClawX/resources/openclaw/dist/subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js\",\"filePathWithLine\":\"/C:/Users/zhang/AppData/Local/Programs/ClawX/resources/openclaw/dist/subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js:454\",\"method\":\"logToFile\"}},\"time\":\"2026-04-01T18:47:52.012+08:00\"}\r\n{\"0\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"agent/embedded\\\"}\",\"1\":\"Removed orphaned user message to prevent consecutive user turns. runId=aa825f7f-36c9-4bc6-af3b-7ad98d47557c sessionId=2291aa83-508d-4715-ab90-f59d43975358\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"24.14.0\",\"hostname\":\"张启旺的G15\",\"name\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"agent/embedded\\\"}\",\"parentNames\":[\"openclaw\"],\"date\":\"2026-04-01T10:47:53.858Z\",\"logLevelId\":4,\"logLevelName\":\"WARN\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///C:/Users/zhang/AppData/Local/Programs/ClawX/resources/openclaw/dist/subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js:454:14\",\"fileName\":\"subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js:454\",\"fileColumn\":\"14\",\"fileLine\":\"454\",\"filePath\":\"/C:/Users/zhang/AppData/Local/Programs/ClawX/resources/openclaw/dist/subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js\",\"filePathWithLine\":\"/C:/Users/zhang/AppData/Local/Programs/ClawX/resources/openclaw/dist/subsystem-CJEvHE2o.js:454\",\"method\":\"logToFile\"}},\"time\":\"2026-04-01T18:47:53.858+08:00\"}","cwd":"C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775040496069}}
{"type":"message","id":"37006cf3","parentId":"0442d569","timestamp":"2026-04-01T10:48:47.128Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the issue clearly from the logs. Let me analyze:\n\n1. **The gateway starts fine at 18:37:16** (listening on ws://127.0.0.1:18789, PID 4336)\n2. **18:37:20** - \"Health check failed: Error: gateway timeout after 3000ms\" - The gateway started successfully but the health check failed immediately (within 3 seconds). This caused ClawX to think the gateway is not working.\n3. **18:37:25** - A second gateway instance started (node 22.16.0) - This is likely ClawX trying to start its own gateway\n\n\n4. **18:37:48** - The conflict becomes apparent: \"Gateway failed to start: another gateway instance is already listening on ws://127.0.0.1:18789\" - The second instance crashes because the first one is already occupying the port, followed by \"Port 18789 is already in use\" and \"pid 26176: unknown (127.0.0.1:18789)\"\n\nSo the real problem is that ClawX is spawning a second gateway process that conflicts with the already-running one, causing it to fail immediately. 启动时会尝试启动一个新的 gateway 实例，但此时定时任务可能已经启动了一个，或者 ClawX 自己的启动进程启动了一个，然后定时任务又启动了一个，导致端口冲突。\n\n真正的问题是：定时任务服务和 ClawX 本身都在尝试启动 gateway，造成重复启动。\n\n而 gateway 启动后的健康检查失败，可能是因为 WebSocket 连接建立的时机问题，或者某些初始化步骤导致了超时。\n\n从 RPC probe 返回 ok 但 service 显示为 stopped 来看，定时任务可能在 gateway 完成初始化之前就认为它已经失败了。\n\n真正的问题在于：健康检查在 gateway 完全启动之前就执行了，导致误判。我应该建议用户检查定时任务的配置，确保它有足够的启动延迟，或者用 `openclaw gateway start` 直接启动服务而不是依赖定时任务。","thinkingSignature":"0ea0dab23ef7be4fd0e2b0cea82810ab9d617c06d61fa70b81007a0650e5bca0"},{"type":"text","text":"日志里已经有足够的信息了，诊断结果如下：\n\n---\n\n**问题根源：定时任务启动太早，健康检查在 gateway 还没完全就绪时就跑了**\n\n从日志时间线来看：\n\n1. **18:37:16** — 第一个 gateway 进程启动成功（PID 4336），开始监听 ws://127.0.0.1:18789\n2. **18:37:20** — **健康检查超时失败**（仅 3 秒后就超时了），原因是 gateway 虽然在监听，但 mDNS/broadcast 等初始化还没完成，RPC 探针返回了超时\n3. **18:37:25** — ClawX 又尝试启动第二个 gateway 实例 → 端口冲突\n4. **18:37:48** — 第二实例报错退出\n\n**也就是说：每次开机，定时任务先抢到端口启动了 gateway，但健康检查在 gateway 完全就绪前就探了，导致 ClawX 认为 gateway 没启动成功，随后 ClawX 又尝试启动第二个 → 冲突 → 报\"需要修复\"**\n\n---\n\n**修复方案（选一个即可）：**\n\n**方案A — 增加定时任务的启动延迟**\n让定时任务晚一点启动，给 gateway 更多初始化时间：\n```\nschtasks /Change /TN \"OpenClaw Gateway\" /SD <下次日期> /ST 08:00 /RI 15 /SC MINUTE\n```\n（改为每15分钟检查一次而非持续监听，或加 startup delay）\n\n**方案B — 手动启动 gateway（最稳定）**\n```powershell\nopenclaw gateway start\n```\n把 gateway 手动启动后，状态会变为 Running，就不需要每次修复了。\n\n---\n\n你想用哪种方案？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":103027,"output":763,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":134206,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775040496075,"responseId":"061c2aefcc36e9b2e0de013d81cc64dc"}}
