{"type":"message","id":"a05dfa25","parentId":"8c5b2286","timestamp":"2026-04-01T10:49:43.352Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the task configuration. The key issue is that there's a `LogonTrigger` with `StartBoundary` set to `2026-04-01T18:30:00`, which means it triggers at logon. And the `DisallowStartIfOnBatteries` is true, which could also cause issues.\n\nLooking at the task settings:\n- `DisallowStartIfOnBatteries: true` - this might cause the task not to start if on battery\n- `StopIfGoingOnBatteries: true`\n- `MultipleInstancesPolicy: IgnoreNew` - this is good, ignores new instances if already running\n  \nThe real problem is that the gateway takes time to fully initialize, but the health check runs after just 3 seconds. I could modify the gateway.cmd to add a startup delay before launching the gateway process, or I could adjust the task settings to prevent it from starting on battery power and add a delay mechanism. The most straightforward fix would be to add a ping delay or sleep command at the beginning of gateway.cmd to give the system time to stabilize before the gateway starts. I'll modify the scheduled task to add a delay trigger, which is the cleanest solution rather than modifying the batch file itself.","thinkingSignature":"2e084446d0c04afce452fb39978efa3e537f12dd71a429fcec7ece2e1dc84c3e"},{"type":"text","text":"找到问题了。定时任务在登录时立即启动，但 gateway 还没完全就绪健康检查就跑了。\n\n最干净的修复方式：在 `gateway.cmd` 前面加一个 10 秒延迟，让系统先稳定下来。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_200b3asd5czp_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\gateway.cmd"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":104547,"output":336,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":135299,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775040571632,"responseId":"061c2b3af51c8739aef48b4fb8080008"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e7cdf5cb","parentId":"a05dfa25","timestamp":"2026-04-01T10:49:43.364Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_200b3asd5czp_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"@echo off\r\nrem OpenClaw Gateway (v2026.3.24)\r\nset \"TMPDIR=C:\\Users\\zhang\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\"\r\nset \"OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PORT=18789\"\r\nset \"OPENCLAW_SYSTEMD_UNIT=openclaw-gateway.service\"\r\nset \"OPENCLAW_WINDOWS_TASK_NAME=OpenClaw Gateway\"\r\nset \"OPENCLAW_SERVICE_MARKER=openclaw\"\r\nset \"OPENCLAW_SERVICE_KIND=gateway\"\r\nset \"OPENCLAW_SERVICE_VERSION=2026.3.24\"\r\nC:\\Users\\zhang\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\ClawX\\resources\\bin\\node.exe C:\\Users\\zhang\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\ClawX\\resources\\openclaw\\dist\\index.js gateway --port 18789\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775040583362}}
