{"type":"message","id":"3920629c","parentId":"5a0a83b9","timestamp":"2026-04-01T11:04:02.904Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to organize the files in the \"D:\\贵阳人文科技学院\" folder. This is a large folder with many files. Let me analyze what I see:\n\nLooking at the structure:\n- 大三上 (Junior Year 1st Semester): VI design work, work study documents, printing assignments, brand planning assignments, design files, modeling practice, cultural creative office system, literature, poster/font work, video assignments\n- 大三下 (Junior Year 2nd Semester): Packaging design, modeling practice, photography course files (lots of photos), electronic books (電子書), documents, materials, videos\n\n\n- 大二下 (Sophomore Year 2nd Semester): Similar structure with photography, design work, reference materials, videos, and documents\n- Root level: Project folders for绣韵水语文创 and 黔之南餐饮主题 VI design projects\n\nThe content is primarily design coursework from a visual communication/design program, with files spanning multiple years and semesters including design projects, photography assignments, reference materials, and project documentation.\n\nI need to organize this by semester and year structure, grouping files into categories like design work, photography, videos, documents, and reference materials rather than moving individual files around. Given the scope and complexity of this reorganization, I should present a clear classification plan for the user to approve before proceeding with any changes.","thinkingSignature":"3da9520e08e34638b4b5fe57299abd5d61fef4405dfbe7197145cb8212499ee7"},{"type":"text","text":"扫描完毕，文件量很大，涉及大二、大三多个学期。这是视觉传达/设计专业的课程作业文件夹，主要内容包括：\n\n**已有目录结构分析：**\n\n| 学期 | 主要内容 |\n|---|---|\n| 大二下 | 摄影课、AE/PR作业、VI设计、字体设计、素材、文档 |\n| 大三上 | VI设计、品牌策划、勤工俭学文件、印刷作业、建模、文献 |\n| 大三下 | 包装设计、建模练习、摄影课所有文件（含大量RAW照片） |\n| 根目录 | VI项目（绣韵水语、黔之南） |\n\n---\n\n整理方案：**优化现有目录结构**，让分类更清晰\n\n建议调整：\n1. `大二下` 下将\"摄影课所有\"子文件夹里嵌套的层级（三级、四级嵌套）扁平化\n2. 将散落的\"圖\"文件夹正式命名为\"参考图\"\n3. 将\"大三上\"的勤工俭学文件单独集中\n4. 将RAW格式（.CR2）和精修处理文件分开归类\n\n你想怎么处理？两个选项：\n\n**A - 只优化目录结构**（不移动文件，只改名/合并混乱的文件夹）\n**B - 全面重新分类**（按课程类型重新组织所有文件，可能涉及大量移动）\n\n哪个更符合你的需求？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":94577,"output":549,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":125542,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775041416460,"responseId":"061c2e8763127175bcbf473ad1f883d8"}}
