{"type":"message","id":"11efa3fe","parentId":"531d1e82","timestamp":"2026-04-01T11:07:29.695Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, there are many CR2 files. Let me use robocopy to move them efficiently. I'll move the entire folder structure at once using robocopy /MOVE.\n\nActually, since there are many files and directories to move, let me take a more systematic approach. Let me write a comprehensive PowerShell script that handles all the moves.\n\nActually, for this scale of operation, I think the best approach is to handle each category one at a time with robocopy. Let me start with the photography category.\n\nFor the photography folder, I need to:\n1. Move CR2 files from various subfolders into `摄影课\\大二下\\原片(RAW)` - keeping their source subfolder names to know where they came from\n\n\n2. Move processed files (精修, 悬浮, etc.) to their respective subdirectories in the new structure\n\nI'll write a PowerShell script that uses robocopy /MOVE to efficiently handle the directory moves while preserving the folder structure.","thinkingSignature":"c5b53060d1cbb5be564a4728f0dcdb1fdf23fc8da1337bbc034613441ad7d830"},{"type":"text","text":"文件量大，用脚本批量处理。先迁移 RAW 原片到 `原片(RAW)` 目录：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_g0ghvq0vx3ib_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8; $src = \"D:\\贵阳人文科技学院\\大二下\\摄影课所有\"; robocopy \"$src\\户外\" \"D:\\贵阳人文科技学院\\📷 摄影课\\大二下\\原片(RAW)\\户外\" /MOVE /E","timeout":60}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":99709,"output":327,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":130452,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775041639056,"responseId":"061c2f6659da52c10439aaf0e5e9c3d5"}}
