{"type":"compaction","id":"04bf725e","parentId":"772173aa","timestamp":"2026-04-01T11:38:33.624Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Diagnose why the OpenClaw gateway needs repair every startup\n2. Organize ebooks in `F:\\电子书` by content theme (71 files: 30 PDF + 38 EPUB + 3 MOBI)\n3. Organize files in `D:\\贵阳人文科技学院\\` by content type (comprehensive reclassification)\n4. Send a test message (completed)\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- User chose \"方式A\" (Plan A) for gateway fix: add startup delay to scheduled task\n- User confirmed \"内容主题\" (content theme) classification for ebooks\n- User confirmed \"方式B\" (full reclassification) for D drive folder\n- User said \"继续\" (continue) when asked to stop or continue\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Diagnosed gateway issue: scheduled task starts gateway too early, health check fails before gateway fully initializes (3-second timeout), then ClawX spawns second instance → port conflict\n- [x] Applied gateway.cmd fix: added `timeout /t 10 /nobreak >nul` 10-second startup delay at the top of `C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\gateway.cmd`\n- [x] Restarted gateway (`openclaw gateway start`)\n- [x] Scanned `F:\\电子书` — 71 files total (30 PDF, 38 EPUB, 3 MOBI)\n- [x] Categorized ebook content: 历史(14), 世界文学(4), 心理学社科(12), 财经商业(2), 艺术设计(16), 政治党史(19), 碑帖书法(1), 食谱(1), 日本文化(2) — **ebook reorganization was planned but not executed**\n- [x] Scanned `D:\\贵阳人文科技学院\\` — massive file collection spanning 大二下/大三上/大三下\n- [x] Created new directory structure under `D:\\贵阳人文科技学院\\` with 8 top-level categories\n- [x] Migrated all files from old semester-based folders to new category-based folders\n- [x] Deleted empty old folders (大三上, 大三下, 大二下, 电子书, etc.)\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] **F:\\电子书 reorganization** — planned and categorized but not executed. Needs: create subfolders (历史, 世界文学, 心理学社科, 财经商业, 艺术设计, 政治党史, 碑帖书法, 食谱, 日本文化) and move 71 files into them.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Gateway fix**: Added 10-second `timeout /t 10 /nobreak >nul` to gateway.cmd before gateway launches — simplest and most reliable fix\n- **D drive reorganization**: Full reclassification (option B) chosen by user; organized by content type (摄影课, 视频与动效, 设计作品, 3D建模, 文档与论文, 设计文献, 素材, 项目文件) while preserving semester context as subfolders\n- **ebook reorganization deferred**: User's repeated focus on D drive caused ebook reorganization to remain planned but unexecuted\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Execute `F:\\电子书` reorganization: create 9 category subfolders and move 71 ebook files into them\n2. Gateway startup delay was applied but not yet verified across a full restart cycle\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Ebooks to organize in F:\\电子书** (71 files total):\n  - 历史(14): 万历十五年, 中国历史常识, 国史大纲, 剑桥中国史, 二十四史, 东晋门阀政治, 天朝的崩溃, 若干重大决策与事件的回顾, 解放的悲劇, 革命造反年代, 十年非梦, 出卖中国, 历史笔记1&2, 筚路维艰, 最后的\"天朝\", 毛泽东与金日成, 一读就上瘾的中国史\n  - 世界文学(4): 百年孤独, 霍乱时期的爱情, 红楼梦, 活着\n  - 心理学社科(12): 社会心理学, 津巴多普通心理学, 非暴力沟通, 亲密关系, 贪婪的多巴胺, 学会提问, 看见, 底层逻辑, 断舍离, 别想太多啦, 也许你该找个人聊聊, 关键对话, 道德经\n  - 财经商业(2): 激荡三十年, 富爸爸穷爸爸\n  - 艺术设计(16): Mucha, 基础图案画法, 排版造型, 今日字体, 动漫人体结构表现技法专项训练, 为绘画角色注入生命力(5本), 透视如此简单, 像艺术家一样思考Ⅲ, 视觉艺术用光, 新摄影笔记, 摄影笔记, CLIP STUDIO PAINT PRO角色绘画教程, Procreate绘画创作从入门到精通\n  - 政治党史(19): 二十大报告, 时政, 职测/行测/申论, 综合素质真题, 中国近代史等\n  - 碑帖书法(1): 中国碑帖名品 爨宝子碑爨龙颜碑\n  - 食谱(1): 大众食堂菜谱 第1辑\n  - 日本文化(2): 失去的三十年, 康熙的红票\n- **Gateway cmd path**: `C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\gateway.cmd` — modified with 10s delay\n- **Gateway scheduled task**: `\\OpenClaw Gateway` — triggers on logon, runs `gateway.cmd`\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Summary\n\n**Original Request:** The user asked to move the entire \"贵阳人文科技学院\" (Guiyang College of Humanities and Technology) folder from D:\\ to F:\\ (the user's data drive), noting F: is their \"资料盘\" (data drive).\n\n**Early Progress:**\n- **Attempt 1 (Move-Item):** Initial `Move-Item` command was executed but the process was killed (SIGKILL) — too large for direct move.\n- **Attempt 2 (robocopy):** Switched to `robocopy \"D:\\贵阳人文科技学院\" \"F:\\贵阳人文科技学院\" /MOVE /E /COPYALL`, running in background session `mild-trail` (pid 28348).\n- The folder contains thousands of files including large video files (mp4/avi, 650MB+), Blender files, CR2 RAW photo sequences, PSD files, and a 3.5GB zip archive.\n\n**Context for Suffix:**\n- robocopy is still actively running and was polled multiple times — showing progress on various large files (CR2 sequences, PSD files ~192MB, video files).\n- The process has been running for a long time and is ongoing. The assistant has been repeatedly polling the background process to monitor completion, with progress updates shared to the user.\n- After completion, the original D:\\ folder will be automatically deleted (MOVE mode).","firstKeptEntryId":"3edb1db9","tokensBefore":235305,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":false}
