{"type":"message","id":"a7c73896","parentId":"aaa5a3f3","timestamp":"2026-04-01T11:48:14.323Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I got a lot of search results. Let me compile the key information for oral broadcasting (口播) content ideas based on the 2026 provincial civil service exam (省考) that just ended.\n\nKey findings from the search:\n1. **2026年公务员笔试圆满落幕** - The 2026 national civil service exam (国考) written exam ended on November 30, with 283.1万 candidates participating across 250 cities, 109,948 exam rooms, with an 87.4% attendance rate.\n\n2. **2026省考** - Multiple provinces completed their exams on March 14-15, 2026:\n   - 23 provinces participated\n   - 586万人 applied\n   - Over 12.6万 recruitment positions\n   - Average competition ratio of 47:1\n\n3. **Key provinces**: Shandong (8332 positions, 398,000 candidates), Gansu (Linxia 14,913 candidates, 8 venues, 515 rooms; Lanzhou 30,000+ candidates, 36 venues, 1004 rooms), Jiangsu (Xuzhou 50,000+ candidates)\n\n4. **2026省考申论** - The essay exam focused on themes like 新质生产力, 基层治理, 乡村振兴, 生态文明\n   \nNow I'm looking at what makes for compelling oral broadcasting content around these exam topics.","thinkingSignature":"5cd827921ddbdb80151a910c278a73eae05c6492514b26082e9e9ef05143252a"},{"type":"text","text":"根据搜索结果，给你整理一下最近省考的热门话题和口播内容方向：\n\n---\n\n## 🔥 2026省考热点速览\n\n**考试规模**\n- 23个省份联考，**586万人**同场角逐\n- 平均竞争比 **47:1**\n- 多省考试在3月14-15日落幕\n\n**各省数据**\n- 山东：计划招录8332人，39.8万人参加\n- 甘肃兰州：3万余人报名，设置36个考点\n- 江苏徐州：5万余人，34所考点\n\n---\n\n## 📌 口播内容方向推荐\n\n**1. 数据盘点类**\n> \"586万人抢12.6万个岗位，竞争最激烈的岗位居然是…\"\n\n**2. 申论热点解读**\n> \"今年省考申论聚焦基层治理、乡村振兴，跟你有什么关系？\"\n\n**3. 考生故事类**\n> \"考场门口的真实故事，有人哭着出来，有人笑着…\"\n\n**4. 考后规划类**\n> \"笔试结束到成绩公布，这段时间你应该做什么？\"\n\n**5. 备考建议类**\n> \"47:1的岗位还要不要冲？过来人告诉你…\"\n\n---\n\n你想做哪个方向的内容？我可以帮你写个口播稿。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":66048,"output":555,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97019,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775044067840,"responseId":"061c38e2c274e517ba62c5287b08c7c5"}}
