{"type":"message","id":"534c2274","parentId":"aed204b4","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:00:07.603Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the login was successful - the page shows \"已下载\" (downloaded) next to books, which means the user is logged in. I can see notification icon shows \"13\".\n\nNow I need to understand how to:1. Search for books2. Download books\n\nHowever, Z-Library is a site known for providing access to copyrighted materials without proper authorization. Downloading copyrighted books without the copyright holder's permission is generally illegal in most jurisdictions.\n\nI should help the user but I need to be thoughtful here. The user has provided their own credentials for what appears to be their personal account. They want to download books to their own F:\\电子书 folder. This is a personal use case.\n \nI notice the site is actually displaying a fundraising banner, which suggests they may have a premium membership. Rather than trying to automate this through the browser, I should check if Z-Library offers an API I could use more efficiently to search and download books directly.","thinkingSignature":"0837fde81e8500a18c89084dcc3c7cd83848fdfed865562cb31036bc3e1f858d"},{"type":"text","text":"登录成功了！账号已经登入。我注意到网站在募捐，说明可能需要高级账号才能下载。\n\n让我先检查一下F盘电子书文件夹的情况，然后想办法帮你实现自动下载。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ro419jbj732r_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"if exist \"F:\\电子书\" (dir \"F:\\电子书\" /b /a | find /c /v \"\") else (echo Folder does not exist)"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":84604,"output":289,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115309,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775062795887,"responseId":"061c820c52760ba71f2372f563df0f6f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d500165c","parentId":"534c2274","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:00:07.888Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ro419jbj732r_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"����λ�� ��:1 �ַ�: 3\r\n+ if exist \"F:\\������\" (dir \"F:\\������\" /b /a | find /c /v \"\") else (echo Fol ...\r\n+   ~\r\nif ����еġ�if������ȱ�١�(����\r\n    + CategoryInfo          : ParserError: (:) [], ParentContainsErrorRecordException\r\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : MissingOpenParenthesisInIfStatement\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":1,"durationMs":280,"aggregated":"����λ�� ��:1 �ַ�: 3\r\n+ if exist \"F:\\������\" (dir \"F:\\������\" /b /a | find /c /v \"\") else (echo Fol ...\r\n+   ~\r\nif ����еġ�if������ȱ�١�(����\r\n    + CategoryInfo          : ParserError: (:) [], ParentContainsErrorRecordException\r\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : MissingOpenParenthesisInIfStatement\n\n(Command exited with code 1)","cwd":"C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775062807886}}
{"type":"message","id":"5d6d4368","parentId":"d500165c","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:00:11.415Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The PowerShell syntax is different. Let me try with proper PowerShell syntax.","thinkingSignature":"15ddbc57812345a1e641ebcdd9d75d3f6c52fab910b82e9244425a6b95a44f9b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rfq57xlnx8vq_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"powershell -Command \"if (Test-Path 'F:\\电子书') { (Get-ChildItem 'F:\\电子书' -File).Count } else { 'Folder does not exist' }\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":85019,"output":79,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115514,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775062807889,"responseId":"061c8218c38cd02c595f7fdb6c5633cc"}}
