{"type":"message","id":"3e93296c","parentId":"5070160d","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:03:03.342Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems the click on the download link didn't open a new page or trigger a download. Let me try to navigate directly to the download URL to see what happens.Actually, I notice the download link is `/dl/aBk5150xZe`. Let me navigate to that directly to see if it triggers a download.","thinkingSignature":"50836a3b37733ec38754c9ed65864773d57cc50f6896d16c9e4f1f86ab98855e"},{"type":"text","text":"看起来下载链接点击没有跳转到下载页面。让我直接访问下载链接试试。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2ahtqa70p34j_1","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"navigate","targetId":"7B22A64B15ED141159232EB4125103CF","url":"https://zh.z-library.sk/dl/aBk5150xZe"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":144782,"output":156,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":175354,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775062965527,"responseId":"061c82b50116a4dd861300da4ca3fbfc"}}
