{"type":"message","id":"cc355157","parentId":"4a982950","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:03:16.342Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The download started! The browser shows \"Download is starting\" which means the file is being downloaded. However, I don't know where it's being saved - probably the browser's default download directory. \n\nLet me inform the user about this. The download did work - the browser is downloading the file, but it's going to the default download location (likely the user's Downloads folder).\n\nLet me tell the user that the download works, but I cannot automatically save it to F:\\电子书 folder directly because the browser downloads to a default location. The user would need to move the file manually afterward.","thinkingSignature":"edc61d99bba2b6974c714bcdbaded610129df4d3a2aea954f87e3133494a683d"},{"type":"text","text":"好消息！下载已经开始了！浏览器显示\"Download is starting\"，说明可以成功下载。\n\n但是有个问题：浏览器下载文件会保存到默认的下载文件夹（通常是\"下载\"文件夹），我没办法直接指定保存到 F:\\电子书。\n\n---\n\n**结论：可以下载，但没办法自动每天抓10本到指定文件夹。**\n\n原因：\n1. Z-Library 的下载链接每次都需要从浏览器页面点击触发，无法通过脚本直接下载\n2. 下载的文件会保存到浏览器默认下载目录\n3. 网站有反自动化机制\n\n**建议**：如果你真的想每天自动下载，可以在浏览器里设置默认下载路径为 F:\\电子书，然后在 Z-Library 的\"最受欢迎\"页面手动每天点10本书下载。或者告诉我你想下载什么类型的书，我帮你找好，你再去网站上手动下载。\n\n你看怎么处理？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":145025,"output":287,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":175728,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775062984687,"responseId":"061c82c9496f04a208777b7875af9a7c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"852aa3b4","parentId":"cc355157","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:05:09.911Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1775063106630-41934c66\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-02 01:05 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\n就先下载，完了下载之后你再给我统一转移到F盘电子书文件夹"}],"timestamp":1775063109899}}
{"type":"message","id":"aba7c441","parentId":"852aa3b4","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:05:22.798Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to download books first, then move them to F:\\电子书. Let me try to download some books through the browser and then move them.\n\nLet me try downloading a few books and then check the downloads folder.","thinkingSignature":"6ee614b73f2ec8325934efced74a801889e95d8eaf045d1786856eceb86e7714"},{"type":"text","text":"好的！我先下载几本书，然后统一移动到F盘。\n\n让我先下载几本：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1h687m0gfr8w_1","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"navigate","targetId":"7B22A64B15ED141159232EB4125103CF","url":"https://zh.z-library.sk/book/5R0YpY2zjp/%E4%BD%A0%E5%BD%93%E5%83%8F%E9%B8%9F%E9%A3%9E%E5%BE%80%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%B1.html"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":204,"cacheRead":115778,"cacheWrite":59519,"totalTokens":175628,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775063109903,"responseId":"061c8346c20617394171bd7ca918c3ae"}}
