{"type":"message","id":"2e121ae8","parentId":"b33d2359","timestamp":"2026-04-01T17:10:56.073Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Only 6 files in the Downloads folder, and none of them are books from Z-Library. \n\nLet me try clicking on the download link for the book and see what happens. The download link for 长安的荔枝 is /dl/aZ6m8Dzkw4. Let me click on it and see if I can track the download.Actually, I realize the fundamental issue: when I use the browser automation tool to click a download link, the browser handles the download but I can't actually capture where the file goes or if it even downloads at all. The browser being used is an isolated browser instance that doesn't share the same download directory as the user's normal browser.\n\nGiven these technical limitations, I should be honest with the user about the situation and suggest an alternative approach - like manually downloading books and then I can help organize them.","thinkingSignature":"341fe6468b91c63f3144025f5111e476059d954bc7c428dbd965163853f1b5eb"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n说实话，我遇到技术限制了。\n\n**问题：**\n1. 我通过浏览器点击下载链接，但文件不会保存到我能访问的文件夹\n2. 下载文件会保存到浏览器的默认下载目录，但我无法自动把文件移动到 F:\\电子书\n3. 每次下载都需要在浏览器里手动操作\n\n**最实用的方案：**\n\n你在 **Chrome/Edge 浏览器** 里设置默认下载路径：\n- 浏览器设置 → 下载 → 位置改为 `F:\\电子书`\n\n然后每天来 Z-Library，**手动点10本历史书下载**，浏览器会自动保存到 F 盘。\n\n**或者**，你告诉我你想下载什么具体的**历史书名**，我去 Z-Library 帮你搜到链接，你再复制到浏览器下载。\n\n你看怎么处理比较好？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":129631,"output":331,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":160378,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775063444721,"responseId":"061c8495d3f929a336c7287345a97154"}}
