{"type":"message","id":"5604ef1f","parentId":"de2d478b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T00:43:15.468Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I got a good list of news from Zaobao. Let me organize this into a summary for the user.","thinkingSignature":"bd0fc7fb054ebdc6d18f79f8df3fd821b187cf5f56c64602ca5544aa1f9ea139"},{"type":"text","text":"**📰 联合早报今日中国新闻（4月2日）**\n\n---\n\n**🔥 最新消息（17分钟前）**\n\n1. **广西出租车司机顶撞执法人员** — 将执法人员顶在引擎盖上行驶百余米，已被拘留\n\n2. **意大利发现疑似失联中国留学生遗体** — 07:40\n\n3. **李强四川调研** — 要求加快能源结构调整优化\n\n---\n\n**📊 中美台海热点**\n\n4. **“习郑会”与“习特会”之先后内外** — 沈泽玮分析：台湾最大在野党领袖郑丽文4月访华，习近平可能接见；特朗普访华时间成焦点\n\n5. **郑丽文：美中关系越好 台湾越安全** — 台湾在野党领袖访华前表态\n\n6. **台湾电影被标\"中国台湾\"** — 国台办称正常合理\n\n7. **当伊朗导弹穿透铁穹，台湾之盾还可行吗？** — 军事评论\n\n8. **赖清德：台对陆投资降至3.7%** — 美国成最大投资目的地\n\n---\n\n**💼 经济财经**\n\n9. **霸王茶姬净利大降52%** — 受外卖大战影响\n\n10. **联想全面转型AI原生公司** — 杨元庆宣布\n\n11. **武汉萝卜快跑集体“瘫痪”** — 乘客被困，引发自动驾驶安全讨论\n\n12. **张雪夺冠后未获重庆资金支持** — 渝浙营商环境对比讨论\n\n---\n\n**🌐 地缘政治**\n\n13. **特朗普：很快撤出伊朗** — 如有必要再回去打击；分析：习特会可能延后\n\n14. **美战争部长：清楚中俄为帮助伊朗采取的行动**\n\n15. **中巴五点倡议** — 中国外交部：欢迎各国参与\n\n16. **俄中正在修建新铁路** — 俄交通部长证实\n\n17. **加拿大财长将访华**\n\n---\n\n**⚖️ 社会法治**\n\n18. **大唐电力原总经理寇伟被判死缓** — 受贿数额特别巨大\n\n19. **香港立法会选举废票创新高** — 学者促优化投票安排\n\n20. **上海交大下架宣传片** — 宣传\"舞台C位变宝妈\"惹议\n\n---\n\n**🔍 热门评论**\n\n- 韩咏红：原\"打虎队员\"周亮落马\n- 下午察：全球最大无人运输机成解放军反航母利器？\n- 分析：特朗普习近平会晤延后，中美或累积更多摩擦\n\n---\n\n需要详细解读哪条吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":149831,"output":581,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":180828,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775090578005,"responseId":"061cee94b88b18026ad0a8ee4f4af57f"}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"57f8b0ce","parentId":"5604ef1f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T01:29:55.572Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. ~~Diagnose why the OpenClaw gateway needs repair every startup~~\n2. ~~Organize `D:\\贵阳人文科技学院\\` by content type~~ (moved to F:\\ as final destination)\n3. ~~Organize ebooks in `F:\\电子书` by content theme~~ (planned but not executed)\n4. **F盘 full reorganization** by usage/purpose\n5. ~~Set up Reuters news collection at 7:30 AM tomorrow~~\n6. ~~Send WeChat message to 林子涵~~ (completed)\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- User chose \"方式A\" (Plan A) for gateway fix: add startup delay to scheduled task\n- User confirmed \"内容主题\" (content theme) classification for ebooks\n- User confirmed \"方式B\" (full reclassification) for D drive folder\n- User wants F盘 reorganized by **用途/usage** (工作、学习、娱乐、备份)\n- x300pro = Vivo X300 Pro手机相册备份\n- WeChat messaging via openclaw-weixin channel; target 林子涵 = llzhh1130@im.wechat\n- User cancelled Z-Library ebook download automation task\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Diagnosed gateway issue and added 10-second delay to `C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\gateway.cmd`\n- [x] Migrated `D:\\贵阳人文科技学院\\` → `F:\\贵阳人文科技学院\\` via robocopy, deleted original\n- [x] Created `memory/2026-04-01.md` (daily diary with task summaries)\n- [x] Sent WeChat message \"由openclaw发出\" to 林子涵 (llzhh1130@im.wechat) — messageId: openclaw-weixin:1775043891369-fe2ceeee\n- [x] Wrote oral broadcast script for 考后规划类 (post-exam planning) topic\n- [x] Set up Windows scheduled task `OpenClaw_ReutersNews` for 2026/04/03 7:30 AM to collect Reuters news via `C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\workspace\\scripts\\fetch_reuters.ps1`\n- [x] Created new F:\\ category folders: 学习资料, 视频剪辑, 游戏, 下载管理, 手机备份, 文档工具\n- [x] Started robocopy of `F:\\BaiduNetdiskDownload` → `F:\\下载管理\\BaiduNetdiskDownload` (in progress, large folder ~1863 files with many large PSD/AI files)\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] **F:\\ robocopy** — BaiduNetdiskDownload → 下载管理, still running (~70%+ complete based on last poll)\n- [ ] **F盘 reorganization** — pending move of remaining folders after robocopy completes:\n  - 学习资料: 作业, 习题, 教育培训, 工程项目建议学院\n  - 视频剪辑: 影片视频剪辑, vi乱码\n  - 游戏: 游戏\n  - 下载管理: idm乱码, monifeixing (after BaiduNetdiskDownload)\n  - 手机备份: x300pro\n  - 文档工具: 文档, 硬盘, sa, u-claw\n  - 空文件夹待删除: Podcasts, 新建文件夹, Alarms, 电影文件夹, Download, WeGameApps, Audiobooks\n\n### Blocked\n- [x] Z-Library ebook automation: cancelled by user; blocked by anti-bot measures and browser download routing limitations\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Gateway fix**: Added 10-second `timeout /t 10 /nobreak >nul` to gateway.cmd before gateway launches\n- **F盘 reorganization**: Categories by usage/purpose; u-claw kept as-is under 文档工具; x300pro = phone photo backup → 手机备份\n- **Z-Library downloads**: Not automated; user cancelled task\n- **Daily Reuters news**: Windows schtasks scheduled task instead of cron; script saves to file for agent to deliver on next interaction\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Wait for robocopy `F:\\BaiduNetdiskDownload` → `F:\\下载管理\\BaiduNetdiskDownload` to complete\n2. Continue moving remaining folders to their category destinations\n3. Delete empty folders (Podcasts, 新建文件夹, Alarms, 电影文件夹, Download, WeGameApps, Audiobooks)\n4. **F:\\电子书 reorganization** still pending from previous session (create 9 category subfolders, move 71 ebook files)\n\n## Critical Context\n- **F盘 folder stats** (from recursive count):\n  - u-claw: 48,157 files\n  - monifeixing: 10,807 files\n  - idm乱码: 10,159 files\n  - 影片视频剪辑: 6,222 files\n  - 工程项目建议学院: 2,327 files\n  - BaiduNetdiskDownload: 1,863 files\n  - x300pro: 1,058 files (vivo X300 Pro相册)\n  - 乱码: 523 files\n  - 作业: 391 files\n  - 教育培训: 326 files\n  - vi乱码: 325 files\n  - 游戏: 71 files\n  - 文档: 67 files\n  - 硬盘: 24 files\n  - sa: 21 files\n  - 备份: 7 files\n  - 习题: 5 files\n- **Robocopy session**: `cool-glade` (pid 3188), source `F:\\BaiduNetdiskDownload`, destination `F:\\下载管理\\BaiduNetdiskDownload`\n- **Reuters cron task**: `OpenClaw_ReutersNews`, scheduled 2026/04/03 7:30 AM, script `C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\workspace\\scripts\\fetch_reuters.ps1`\n- **Ebooks to organize in F:\\电子书** (71 files): 历史(14), 世界文学(4), 心理学社科(12), 财经商业(2), 艺术设计(16), 政治党史(19), 碑帖书法(1), 食谱(1), 日本文化(2)\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nThe user asked to read HEARTBEAT.md (from workspace path) and follow its instructions. The heartbeat indicated a completed robocopy task (BaiduNetdiskDownload → 下载管理, 12.4 GB, code 1) and asked to continue organizing folders.\n\n## Early Progress\n- Completed moving BaiduNetdiskDownload (12.4 GB) to 下载管理; deleted the empty source folder\n- Identified remaining folders on F:\\ and mapped them to target destinations:\n  - **idm乱码** → 下载管理 (IDM downloads)\n  - **vi乱码** → 视频剪辑 (VI design files)\n  - **作业** → 学习资料 (assignments)\n  - **文档** → 文档工具 (documents)\n  - **习题** → 学习资料 (exercises)\n  - **备份** → 文档工具 (backup)\n  - **电影相关**, **字幕乱码**, etc. → 视频剪辑 or other targets\n- Started background robocopy for monifeixing (Flight Simulator content) → 下载管理\n- Started background robocopy for x300pro (phone backup) → 手机备份\n- Hit encoding issues with Chinese folder names in PowerShell/cmd\n- Used Python to correctly list actual folder names\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- Two large background processes (monifeixing ~98%+, x300pro in progress) are still running\n- The suffix starts with a failed PowerShell command: `Get-ChildItem` with `Where-Object` that had a typo (`_.Name` instead of `$_.Name`), causing command parsing errors\n- The task is waiting for background transfers to complete while attempting to move remaining smaller folders\n\n<read-files>\nC:\\Users\\zhang\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\ClawX\\resources\\openclaw\\skills\\tavily-search\\SKILL.md\n</read-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"3d0f0e50","tokensBefore":180828,"details":{"readFiles":["C:\\Users\\zhang\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\ClawX\\resources\\openclaw\\skills\\tavily-search\\SKILL.md"],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":false}
