{"type":"message","id":"321c688f","parentId":"7c079cd8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T01:31:46.360Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Baidu search results are quite cluttered with ads and navigation. But I can see some useful information about public exam (公考) interview hot topics. Let me synthesize what I found from these search results:\n\n**2026年公考面试热点 topics visible from search results:**\n\n1. **新质生产力** - The core driving force is technological innovation\n2. **人工智能** - AI development and its impact on employment, privacy, algorithm discrimination\n3. **乡村振兴** - Rural revitalization (very important topic)\n4. **智慧养老** - Smart elderly care services\n5. **一人公司** - New business model (self-employed/one-person companies)\n6. **网络谣言** - Online rumors and false information\n7. **突发公共事件** - Public emergency events and government response\n8. **创新生态与产业协同** - Innovation ecosystem and industrial collaboration (机器人6S店)\n9. **审计署面试** - Audit agency specific interviews\n\n**Recent hot topics from the news articles:**\n- 解放军报披露日本已具备拥核能力\n- 大雾+沙尘暴+暴雨+大风4预警齐发\n- 中国\"东西大动脉\"要来了\n- \"在美出生即公民\"或彻底终结\n- 义务教育摇号\"可以操作\"系谣言\n\nFrom the content snippets, I can see some specific interview questions and topics:\n\n\n1. **现象认知** - For example: AI's impact on employment\n2. **观点认知** - Views on various social phenomena\n3. **组织活动** - Organizing activities\n4. **解决问题** - Problem solving\n5. **情景模拟** - Scenario simulation\n\nThe interview hot topics seem to focus on technological innovation and social governance issues. I should provide this analysis to the user since they've asked about Douyin content and what oral broadcast topics would work well.\n\nFrom what I can gather, the trending categories on Douyin for public exam content include exam strategy videos, current events analysis for exams, interview skills, inspirational success stories, and knowledge-based explanations. These align with the key themes emerging from the interview questions I've identified.","thinkingSignature":"3510564691b964392310b71b996d0253ebcf732aeadad75aa4a5e5e21a929f4d"},{"type":"text","text":"根据百度搜索结果，帮你整理了**2026年公考面试热点**，这些话题适合做抖音口播：\n\n---\n\n**🔥 核心时政热点（必考）**\n\n1. **新质生产力** — 核心驱动力是\"科技创新\"，这是今年最重要概念\n2. **人工智能** — 就业冲击、数据隐私、算法歧视（可结合chatgpt、Sora等热点）\n3. **乡村振兴** — 组织振兴、城乡融合、乡村特色产业（如三涧溪村案例）\n4. **政府舆情应对** — 突发公共事件的信息发布和舆论引导\n5. **智慧养老** — 社区养老服务的信息化建设\n\n---\n\n**💡 新业态新模式（江苏面试已考）**\n\n6. **\"一人公司\"** — 灵活就业新趋势\n7. **地摊经济/小店经济** — 总理点赞过的\n8. **平台经济监管** — 互联网巨头反垄断\n\n---\n\n**🎯 社会治理热点**\n\n9. **网络谣言治理** — 虚假信息传播\n10. **基层治理创新** — 社区治理现代化\n11. **法治政府建设** — 依法行政\n\n---\n\n**🎬 口播方向建议**\n\n| 类型 | 话题举例 | 时长 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **热点解读** | \"河南小麦收割为什么被骂？\" | 1-2分钟 |\n| **面试技巧** | \"考官最爱问的三个问题\" | 2-3分钟 |\n| **真题分析** | \"乡村振兴怎么答才能拿高分\" | 3-5分钟 |\n| **励志故事** | \"上岸学长的血泪经验\" | 1-2分钟 |\n\n---\n\n**⚡ 今日可蹭热点（抖音爆款）**\n\n- 张雪夺冠 → 营商环境对比 / 地域发展差异\n- 武汉萝卜快跑瘫痪 → AI对就业冲击 / 自动驾驶监管\n- 伊朗战争 → 国际格局变化 / 能源安全\n\n---\n\n要我帮你写某个话题的完整口播脚本吗？比如\"乡村振兴\"或\"AI与就业\"。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":145546,"output":872,"cacheRead":30416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":176834,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775093474841,"responseId":"061cf9e46e4b02ee862a32a98aacb435"}}
