{"type":"message","id":"8a665539","parentId":"b8681d5b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T01:51:23.882Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see there's \"上传图文\" mentioned twice in the text. Let me try to navigate directly to the image/text upload page or click on \"上传图文\" link. Let me try using a different approach - maybe navigate to the specific URL for uploading image/text.\n\nActually, looking at the page, it seems like the default view is for video upload. I need to find and click on \"上传图文\" to switch to图文 mode. Let me try to look for a link or button for uploading images/text.\n\nLet me try clicking on the \"上传图文\" text that appears in the sidebar.","thinkingSignature":"a8f7ec61b32dbc6d724fae6009497a9eedd85fa1788f4fb8eb4582f7e8ed6445"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4oxddyyywtac_1","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"navigate","targetId":"2BFAC05207CCB290013AF240CDA5B6BC","url":"https://creator.xiaohongshu.com/publish/publish?type=normal&source=official"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":21907,"output":206,"cacheRead":30919,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53032,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775094677682,"responseId":"061cfe960e0ba12fdee7d59d1bdc0300"}}
