{"type":"message","id":"26067b26","parentId":"9d6d04c3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T04:19:35.182Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have enough data to compile a comprehensive design trend report. Let me also check the graphic design category to get a fuller picture, and then I'll compile everything into a nice report.\n\nFrom the data I've collected:\n\n**Behance Best of (March 2026) - Trending Styles:**\n\n1. **Brand Identity / Visual Identity** - Very hot\n   - Relash Visual Identity (100 likes)\n   - AUGUST NEW YORK Brand Identity (139 likes)\n   - COZSENSE 家居品牌设计 (201 likes)\n   - GBA Studios Visual Identity & Website (222 likes)\n   - Vivantis Rebrand & Concept (247 likes)\n   - Sous Forme Brand Identity (274 likes)\n\n2. **Illustration** - Extremely popular\n   - TAP illustrations (236 likes)\n   - Illustrations for Turisanda (100 likes)\n   - Bus advertisement illustration (122 likes)\n   - Doodles spring 2026 (189 likes)\n   - Countryside (205 likes)\n   - Birds & Cats (274 likes)\n   - Corriere della Sera Illustrations (225 likes)\n   - Illustration Collection XVI (339 likes)\n\n3. **Packaging Design with 3D Rendering**\n   - Sandisk Packaging Design & 3D Renderings (468 likes)\n\n4. **Isometric Design**\n   - Isometric Boxes — Modular Experiences (454 likes)\n\n5. **Motion/Animation**\n   - The Doll Shop - trailer\n   - KanKan (168 likes)\n\n6. **Typography/Lettering**\n   - LOGOFOLIO series (multiple entries, 83-431 likes)\n\n7. **Photography**\n   - México March 2026\n   - 130126 (Thibault Delhom)\n\n**UI/UX Trends (March 2026):**\n\n1. **AI-powered apps** - Very dominant\n   - AI Agent for Tech Teams (387 likes)\n   - lifeOS Personal AI Agents App (323 likes)\n   - Miyagi Labs UX/UI (303 likes)\n   - OZY AI 3D Hardware + UI (453 likes)\n   - Fashion E-Commerce with AI Shopping (526 likes)\n\n2. **FinTech / Banking apps**\n   - Whitebird Bank FinTech UI (325 likes)\n\n3. **Healthcare/Wellness apps**\n   - Serena Medical Healthcare App (432 likes)\n   - Vitaio Health Tracking (439 likes)\n   - Wellness Aging Care app\n\n4. **Glassmorphism**\n   - Fluid Glass (737 likes!) - VERY HOT\n\n5. **XR/AR experiences**\n   - COVI: XR-based Interactive Content Platform (406 likes)\n\n6. **Sticker packs**\n   - Signal Winter Stickers (279 likes)\n   - PAPRIKO Robots Animated Stickers (170 likes)\n\n7. **Automotive HMI**\n   - 2022 Lincoln Zephyr - HMI (561 likes)\n   - AudiF1 (469 likes)\n\n8. **Weather/Everyday apps**\n   - Samsung Weather App (372 likes)\n\n9. **E-commerce**\n   - Fashion E-Commerce with AI (526 likes)\n\n10. **Charging/Energy apps**\n    - Charging stations app (953 views)\n\n**Key Design Styles to Highlight:**\n\n1. **Glassmorphism (流体玻璃)** - Biggest UI trend, Fluid Glass got 737 likes\n2. **AI-powered interfaces** - Every category has AI integration\n3. **3D Packaging** - 3D renderings in packaging design\n4. **Isometric** - Still going strong\n5. **Motion/Animation** - Increased presence\n6. **Brand Identity** - Minimalist but bold\n7. **Doodles/Hand-drawn** - Getting popular\n8. **Healthcare/Wellness** - Big growth area\n9. **FinTech** - Still very active\n10. **XR/AR** - Emerging strong\n\nLet me compile this into a nice report.","thinkingSignature":"d21028a34a908e7042ac928c8b5047062a271eed4b8637df874ccb98c1932865"},{"type":"text","text":"够了！我已经收集到了足够的数据。让我帮你整理一下**Behance 2026年3-4月设计趋势报告**：\n\n---\n\n# 🎨 Behance 2026年春季设计趋势\n\n## 🔥 最热门风格（易出效果）\n\n### 1. 玻璃拟态 Glassmorphism ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**热度爆表！** 单个作品获得 **737 点赞**\n- 特点：毛玻璃质感、半透明、模糊背景\n- 配色建议：紫色/蓝色渐变 + 白色高光\n- 应用场景：App界面、卡片、按钮\n- 代表作：Fluid Glass\n\n### 2. AI驱动的界面设计 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**几乎每个热门UI作品都有AI元素**\n- AI Agent 管理界面（387赞）\n- AI购物功能（526赞）\n- AI + 3D 硬件结合（453赞）\n- 关键词：智能助手、Chat界面、AI工作流\n\n### 3. 3D包装设计 ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**传统平面 × 3D渲染 = 新趋势**\n- Sandisk包装设计（468赞）\n- 结合Blender/C4D渲染\n- 强调：光影、材质、真实感\n\n---\n\n## 📱 UI/UX 高赞分类\n\n| 类型 | 点赞量 | 特点 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| **Glassmorphism风格** | 737 👍 | 流体玻璃、模糊背景 |\n| **时尚电商+AI** | 526 👍 | AI试穿、智能推荐 |\n| **医疗健康App** | 430+ 👍 | 健康追踪、用药提醒 |\n| **FinTech银行** | 325 👍 | 深色主题、数据可视化 |\n| **汽车HMI** | 469 👍 | 仪表盘、驾驶界面 |\n| **天气App** | 372 👍 | 动态背景、玻璃质感 |\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 插画/平面设计趋势\n\n### 热门风格：\n1. **手绘涂鸦 Doodles** — 轻松随意，春日感强\n   - Doodles spring 2026（189赞）\n   \n2. **品牌视觉 Identity** — 简约但有个性\n   - COZSENSE 家居品牌（201赞）\n   - AUGUST NEW YORK（139赞）\n   \n3. **等距插画 Isometric** — 依然很火\n   - Isometric Boxes（454赞）\n   \n4. **复古风插画** — 色彩鲜艳、扁平化\n   - Corriere della Sera（225赞）\n   - TAP illustrations（236赞）\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ 工具组合推荐\n\n| 风格 | 推荐工具 |\n|------|----------|\n| 玻璃拟态UI | Figma + Apple design resources |\n| 3D包装 | Blender + Cinema 4D |\n| 等距插画 | Illustrator + Isometric插件 |\n| 手绘涂鸦 | Procreate / Fresco |\n| 品牌设计 | Illustrator + Figma |\n| 动效设计 | After Effects / Lottie |\n\n---\n\n## 💡 快速上手建议\n\n**如果你想跟风做设计：**\n\n1. **最容易出效果** → Glassmorphism风格 UI\n   - 用Figma做个天气App界面，套用玻璃卡片\n   - 教程多、上手快、甲方喜欢\n\n2. **最容易拿赞** → 插画类\n   - 手绘涂鸦风格最近很火\n   - 用Procreate画一组春日主题\n\n3. **最有前景** → AI + UI结合\n   - 做一套AI助手界面概念设计\n   - 展示AI对话/工作流/数据分析\n\n---\n\n需要我帮你深入研究某个风格，或者找一些参考作品链接吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":57593,"output":1583,"cacheRead":30919,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90095,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775103532664,"responseId":"061d212dbbfd5d2cffde2758dcba1ada"}}
