] [nth=6]\n        - text: 对 Brew Lab - Brand Identity的263 赞赏 Brew Lab - Brand Identity 的 NaN 视图\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9376e358382516f4\">>>"}],"details":{"ok":true,"format":"ai","targetId":"D53D9EB1FE50C260FCF7582813124D4B","url":"https://www.behance.net/galleries/graphic-design","stats":{"lines":527,"chars":26168,"refs":218,"interactive":213},"refs":218,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"browser","kind":"snapshot","format":"ai","wrapped":true}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775112065940}}
{"type":"message","id":"5642b75e","parentId":"604269a3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:41:51.262Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good overview of the graphic design category. Let me also check the branding subcategory to get more specific trends.\n\nBased on the data I've collected, here's what I see trending in graphic design:\n\n**High-engagement graphic design projects:**\n\n1. **Branding/品牌推广** - Very popular\n   - KINO PAVASARIS (318 likes)\n   - Lumere (732 likes) - MAXIMUM!\n   - 东方茶肆｜新中式茶饮 (374 likes)\n   - Cafe Klee (464 likes)\n   - Petra (335 likes)\n\n2. **Packaging/包装**\n   - Skincare Brand Identity & Packaging (310 likes)\n   - MOONIES Cookies Packaging (182 likes)\n   - highbar Brand Identity & Packaging (193 likes)\n\n3. **Logo/徽标**\n   - LOGOFOLIO EP.02 (110 likes)\n   - LOGOS & MASCOT COLLECTION (279 likes)\n\n4. **Typography/排版**\n   - SLTF Arcilla - Variable Editorial Serif (55 likes but expensive $149 font)\n   - Grecotipo (349 likes)\n\n5. **Editorial/编辑**\n   - Rituals 04 (103 likes)\n\n6. **Graphic Design/图形设计**\n   - Magenta No Thanks! (131 likes)\n   - Paper Art Cards (88 likes)\n\nKey observations:\n- **Brand identity projects** combining branding + packaging are very popular\n- **Minimalist luxury** aesthetic is trending (especially in skincare, coffee brands)\n- **Variable fonts** are being highlighted\n- **New Chinese tea drink** (新中式茶饮) style is getting attention\n- **Magenta/bold colors** in graphic design\n- **Paper art/手工纸艺** is a unique trend\n\nLet me summarize this for the user in Chinese.","thinkingSignature":"a3bdbc6a76009183fd51bc9ad6f444c8a19ce8147b310d039b9c88fd04ef7be3"},{"type":"text","text":"好的！我整理一下**Behance 2026春季平面设计趋势**：\n\n---\n\n# 🎨 平面设计趋势报告\n\n## 🏆 最热门分类（按点赞排序）\n\n| 排名 | 类型 | 最高点赞 | 趋势解读 |\n|------|------|----------|----------|\n| 1 | **品牌全案** | 732 | 品牌+包装+视觉全套 |\n| 2 | **极简包装** | 310+ | 简约高端护肤品/食品 |\n| 3 | **新中式品牌** | 374 | 中国风茶饮/餐饮 |\n| 4 | **咖啡品牌** | 464 | 精品咖啡VI |\n| 5 | **字体设计** | 349 | 可变字体/编辑字体 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔥 五大热门风格\n\n### 1. 极简高端品牌 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** Lumere (732赞)、Café Klee (464赞)\n\n**特点：**\n- 大量留白\n- 单一配色或双色搭配\n- 精致的包装材质感\n- 常用于：护肤品、香水、精品咖啡\n\n**配色建议：**\n- 米白 + 金色\n- 深灰 + 烫金\n- 纯白 + 品牌色\n\n---\n\n### 2. 新中式茶饮 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** 东方茶肆 (374赞)\n\n**特点：**\n- 传统水墨元素 + 现代排版\n- 书法字体融合\n- 中国传统色彩（青瓷绿、朱砂红）\n- 常用于：茶饮、中式甜点、文创\n\n---\n\n### 3. 可变字体 Typography ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** Grecotipo (349赞)、SLTF Arcilla\n\n**特点：**\n- Variable Font（可变字体）\n- 一套字体多种粗细/宽度\n- 衬线体回归（Serif回潮）\n- 常用于：品牌VI、编辑设计\n\n---\n\n### 4. 3D包装 × 实物模拟 ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** Skincare包装 (310赞)、Sandisk (之前看到的468赞)\n\n**特点：**\n- Blender/C4D渲染逼真产品图\n- 磨砂质感、玻璃质感\n- 霓虹/荧光配色\n- 常用于：数码产品、护肤品\n\n---\n\n### 5. 手绘涂鸦插画 ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** Doodles spring 2026 (189赞)\n\n**特点：**\n- 轻松随性的线条\n- 明亮跳跃的色彩\n- 春日感、治愈系\n- 常用于：贴纸、卡片、社交媒体配图\n\n---\n\n## 📊 子类目详细数据\n\n### 包装设计 Packaging\n| 作品 | 点赞 | 风格 |\n|------|------|------|\n| Skincare Brand Identity | 310 | 极简高端 |\n| MOONIES Cookies | 182 | 可爱卡通 |\n| highbar Brand | 193 | 精酿啤酒 |\n\n### 品牌推广 Branding\n| 作品 | 点赞 | 风格 |\n|------|------|------|\n| Lumere | 732 | 极简奢华 |\n| Café Klee | 464 | 现代简约 |\n| 东方茶肆 | 374 | 新中式 |\n| Roma Jazz Festival | 131 | 复古几何 |\n\n### 字体设计 Typography\n| 作品 | 点赞 | 特点 |\n|------|------|------|\n| Grecotipo | 349 | 西班牙风格衬线 |\n| SLTF Arcilla | 55 | 编辑字体卖$149 |\n\n### Logo设计\n| 作品 | 点赞 | 风格 |\n|------|------|------|\n| LOGOS & MASCOT | 279 | 卡通形象 |\n| LOGOFOLIO EP.02 | 110 | 极简字母 |\n\n---\n\n## 💡 快速上手建议\n\n**最容易出效果：**\n1. **护肤品包装** — 极简风格 + 3D渲染\n2. **咖啡店品牌VI** — 复古海报 + 现代排版\n3. **新中式文创** — 传统元素再设计\n\n**最易获得点赞：**\n- 可变字体设计展示\n- 品牌全案展示（从logo到包装）\n- 动效+平面的结合\n\n**工具推荐：**\n| 风格 | 工具 |\n|------|------|\n| 品牌VI | Illustrator + Figma |\n| 3D包装 | Blender + Cinema 4D |\n| 字体设计 | Glyphs / RoboFont |\n| 手绘插画 | Procreate / Fresco |\n| 包装展示 | Photoshop Mockup |\n\n---\n\n需要我帮你深入研究某个具体风格，或者找一些参考链接吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":66682,"output":1380,"cacheRead":30919,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98981,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775112065945,"responseId":"061d428295aea3d52e7cc51eec492b49"}}
