{"type":"message","id":"351b4699","parentId":"a3440ebc","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:45:25.485Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I don't see the screenshots I just took. They might be saved in a temporary location or sent as tool results and not saved to disk. Let me try a different approach - let me save the screenshots with explicit paths, or I can save the canvas screenshots.\n\nActually, looking at the canvas tool, I should use it to capture and save screenshots. But I tried that and it didn't work.\n\nLet me try a different approach - I'll save a text summary to the folder and also tell the user that the screenshots are available in the current browser session, or I can help them download them manually.\n\nActually, let me just save the design trends report as a text/markdown file in the folder, and tell the user that the screenshots are in the current browser tabs. They can right-click and save them if needed.","thinkingSignature":"ef28b7e3e0a345107a9b48ef270763b5d3c66244ef78ca29021568aee16f7104"},{"type":"text","text":"截图似乎没有自动保存到文件夹，让我把采集的报告保存到文件夹里，你可以直接从浏览器里查看这些项目：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7kpuuzzwspps_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\workspace\\Behance_Trends_2026\\平面设计趋势报告.md","content":"# 🎨 Behance 2026春季平面设计趋势报告\n\n采集时间：2026年4月2日\n来源：Behance作品精选 + 图形设计分类\n\n---\n\n## 🏆 最热门分类（按点赞排序）\n\n| 排名 | 类型 | 最高点赞 | 趋势解读 |\n|------|------|----------|----------|\n| 1 | 品牌全案 | 732 | 品牌+包装+视觉全套 |\n| 2 | 极简包装 | 310+ | 简约高端护肤品/食品 |\n| 3 | 新中式品牌 | 374 | 中国风茶饮/餐饮 |\n| 4 | 咖啡品牌 | 464 | 精品咖啡VI |\n| 5 | 字体设计 | 349 | 可变字体/编辑字体 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔥 五大热门风格\n\n### 1. 极简高端品牌 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** Lumere (732赞)、Café Klee (464赞)\n\n**特点：**\n- 大量留白\n- 单一配色或双色搭配\n- 精致的包装材质感\n- 常用于：护肤品、香水、精品咖啡\n\n**配色建议：**\n- 米白 + 金色\n- 深灰 + 烫金\n- 纯白 + 品牌色\n\n---\n\n### 2. 新中式茶饮 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** 东方茶肆 (374赞)\n\n**特点：**\n- 传统水墨元素 + 现代排版\n- 书法字体融合\n- 中国传统色彩（青瓷绿、朱砂红）\n- 常用于：茶饮、中式甜点、文创\n\n---\n\n### 3. 可变字体 Typography ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** Grecotipo (349赞)、SLTF Arcilla\n\n**特点：**\n- Variable Font（可变字体）\n- 一套字体多种粗细/宽度\n- 衬线体回归（Serif回潮）\n- 常用于：品牌VI、编辑设计\n\n---\n\n### 4. 3D包装 × 实物模拟 ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** Skincare包装 (310赞)\n\n**特点：**\n- Blender/C4D渲染逼真产品图\n- 磨砂质感、玻璃质感\n- 霓虹/荧光配色\n- 常用于：数码产品、护肤品\n\n---\n\n### 5. 手绘涂鸦插画 ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n**代表作品：** Doodles spring 2026 (189赞)\n\n**特点：**\n- 轻松随性的线条\n- 明亮跳跃的色彩\n- 春日感、治愈系\n- 常用于：贴纸、卡片、社交媒体配图\n\n---\n\n## 📊 子类目详细数据\n\n### 包装设计 Packaging\n| 作品 | 点赞 | 风格 |\n|------|------|------|\n| Skincare Brand Identity | 310 | 极简高端 |\n| MOONIES Cookies | 182 | 可爱卡通 |\n| highbar Brand | 193 | 精酿啤酒 |\n\n### 品牌推广 Branding\n| 作品 | 点赞 | 风格 |\n|------|------|------|\n| Lumere | 732 | 极简奢华 |\n| Café Klee | 464 | 现代简约 |\n| 东方茶肆 | 374 | 新中式 |\n| Roma Jazz Festival | 131 | 复古几何 |\n\n### 字体设计 Typography\n| 作品 | 点赞 | 特点 |\n|------|------|------|\n| Grecotipo | 349 | 西班牙风格衬线 |\n| SLTF Arcilla | 55 | 编辑字体卖$149 |\n\n### Logo设计\n| 作品 | 点赞 | 风格 |\n|------|------|------|\n| LOGOS & MASCOT | 279 | 卡通形象 |\n| LOGOFOLIO EP.02 | 110 | 极简字母 |\n\n---\n\n## 💡 快速上手建议\n\n**最容易出效果：**\n1. 护肤品包装 — 极简风格 + 3D渲染\n2. 咖啡店品牌VI — 复古海报 + 现代排版\n3. 新中式文创 — 传统元素再设计\n\n**最易获得点赞：**\n- 可变字体设计展示\n- 品牌全案展示（从logo到包装）\n- 动效+平面的结合\n\n**工具推荐：**\n| 风格 | 工具 |\n|------|------|\n| 品牌VI | Illustrator + Figma |\n| 3D包装 | Blender + Cinema 4D |\n| 字体设计 | Glyphs / RoboFont |\n| 手绘插画 | Procreate / Fresco |\n| 包装展示 | Photoshop Mockup |\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 高赞项目链接收藏\n\n1. **Lumere 极简品牌** - https://www.behance.net/gallery/230357035/Lumere\n2. **Café Klee 咖啡品牌** - https://www.behance.net/gallery/229519127/Caf-Klee\n3. **东方茶肆 新中式** - https://www.behance.net/gallery/231061057/_\n4. **Skincare 包装** - https://www.behance.net/gallery/245671273/Skincare-Brand-Identity-Packaging-design\n5. **Grecotipo 字体** - https://www.behance.net/gallery/245613111/Grecotipo\n6. **Magenta No Thanks** - https://www.behance.net/gallery/246137989/Magenta-No-Thanks\n7. **LOGOFOLIO EP.02** - https://www.behance.net/gallery/246650543/LOGOFOLIO-EP02\n8. **COZSENSE 家居品牌** - https://www.behance.net/gallery/246480571/COZSENSE\n\n---\n\n采集完成！图片请在浏览器中查看或右键保存。\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":71539,"output":1482,"cacheRead":30919,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103940,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775112301860,"responseId":"061d436e2eb46c6f0cb32b271e7a13d6"}}
