{"type":"message","id":"4d8a633a","parentId":"a9e13661","timestamp":"2026-04-03T07:38:22.874Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to give them another script. Let me pick a different topic from the Douyin search results - maybe the \"应急应变\" type that was popular, or the \"观点鲜明\" type, or maybe something about practical tips for interview.\n\nLet me write another 1-minute script with a different angle.","thinkingSignature":"a84a803b4fe3c94341009a38aa48663f0f00af19ef313574f8410e2e6071f4fd"},{"type":"text","text":"**🔥 口播脚本2（1分钟）**\n\n---\n\n\"应急应变题，就是送分题！\n\n很多人答不好，是因为开头就错了。\n\n你说'我会保持冷静、耐心沟通'，\n这种话一出口，分就丢了。\n\n为什么？\n\n因为考官想听的不是态度，\n是你怎么解决问题。\n\n记住三个字：定、做、改。\n\n定，是定性问题。\n先判断这事反映出什么。\n\n做，是处置动作。\n给出具体办法，不是表决心。\n\n改，是长效机制。\n事后怎么防止再发生。\n\n就这么简单。\n\n练熟这个思路，\n遇到应急题，你就赢了。\"\n\n---\n\n这个怎么样？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":189,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":118785,"totalTokens":119101,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775201883689,"responseId":"061ea15aae7a98a36b4a9ad0401cba05"}}
{"type":"message","id":"38da070f","parentId":"4d8a633a","timestamp":"2026-04-03T07:39:42.509Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1775201979011-d100cd28\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-03 15:39 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\n做点干货拆解"}],"timestamp":1775201982500}}
{"type":"message","id":"55034bba","parentId":"38da070f","timestamp":"2026-04-03T07:39:55.030Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants some practical, substantial content breakdown - like taking a real exam question and showing how to answer it properly. Let me create a script that actually dissects a real interview question and shows the thought process.","thinkingSignature":"0c5e2caaa3aeb3a4a70141a4b308ceaafb9b4bc3fd758ac90994b0edf669eb01"},{"type":"text","text":"**🔥 干货拆解（1分钟）**\n\n---\n\n\"来道真刀真枪的面试题：\n\n'群众来办事，材料不全，在大厅大吵大闹，你怎么办？'\n\n大部分人会说：\n'我会保持冷静，微笑服务，帮群众补齐材料...'\n\n这种答案，千篇一律，考官听到想打瞌睡。\n\n教你三步翻盘：\n\n**第一步：定性**\n别急着解释，先判断问题。\n'这反映出窗口服务存在告知不清晰的问题。'\n\n**第二步：处置**\n给出具体动作。\n'我会上前安抚情绪，启动容缺受理，先办后补，让群众少跑一趟。'\n\n**第三步：长效机制**\n别忘了最后一句。\n'事后我会梳理事项清单，在大厅张贴告知，避免同类问题再次发生。'\n\n记住：\n态度不值钱，动作才值钱。\n考官要听的，是你像不像个能做事的人。\"\n\n---\n\n这道题够硬吗？要不要再来一道？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":240,"cacheRead":118752,"cacheWrite":223,"totalTokens":119342,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775201982503,"responseId":"061ea1bd90f933e28ab4cb59a8d0aef3"}}
